And in the same time it is Rahbania(رهبانية),

1089
01:26:38,927 --> 01:26:44,515
Ibadah(عبادة), reciting Qur'an, Zikr(زكر) of Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ, Salah(صلاة), fasting, Talab-Ul-Ilm(طلب ألعلم).

1090
01:26:46,530 --> 01:26:49,807
Sahabah رضي الله عنهم who are living in Arabia,

1091
01:26:50,334 --> 01:26:54,378
they traveled all over the world. Spreading the religion of Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ.

