Tourism of my Ummah(امة) is Jihad(جهاد) Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله).

1098
01:27:23,017 --> 01:27:24,842
He is enjoying of Khalq(خلق) of Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ.

1099
01:27:28,007 --> 01:27:29,689
The pinnacle of Islam is Jihad(جهاد).

1100
01:27:30,450 --> 01:27:38,011
Actually, let me read you the statement of the Hadith(حديث) of Siyaha(سياحة) in Abu Umamah(أبوأمامة)

1101
01:27:38,814 --> 01:27:42,128
narrates the Messenger of Allah said: The Siyaha(سياحة) of my nation is Jihad(جهاد).

1102
01:27:42,573 --> 01:27:44,628
This is an Abu Daud(أبوداؤد) and Al-Hakim(ألحاكم).

1103
01:27:44,974 --> 01:27:49,759
And then, Ibn Nuhas(إبن نُحاس) says: Siyaha(سياحة) is the traveling in the earth to flee evil,

1104
01:27:50,059 --> 01:27:52,063
and to contemplate in the creation of Allah.

1105
01:27:52,397 --> 01:27:56,141
Since Jihad(جهاد) involves all of that, it becomes the Siyaha(سياحة),

1106
01:27:56,738 --> 01:27:59,310
because the Mujahid(مُجَاهِد) is fleeing towards the Creator.

1107
01:28:00,721 --> 01:28:02,028
The pinnacle of Islam is Jihad(جهاد).

1108
01:28:02,204 --> 01:28:03,870
Muadh ibn Jabal( معاذ إبن جبل) narrates:

1109
01:28:04,509 --> 01:28:07,851
We were with the Messenger of Allah returning from Tabook(تبوك), he told me:

1110
01:28:08,755 --> 01:28:13,317
If you want I can tell you, the head of the matter, its pillar and its peak,

1111
01:28:13,517 --> 01:28:14,923
I said: Yes! O messenger of Allah,

1112
01:28:14,967 --> 01:28:17,497
he said: The head of the matter is Islam.

1113
01:28:17,873 --> 01:28:20,604
Its pillar is Salah(صلاة) and its peak as Jihad(جهاد).

1114
01:28:21,250 --> 01:28:25,181
This is in Al-Hakim(ألحاكم), Ahmad(أحمد), At-Tirmidhi(ألتِّرمِذِيْ), and Ibn-e-Majah(إبن ماجه).

1115
01:28:27,336 --> 01:28:29,456
The Mujahid(مُجَاهِد) is given a guaranteed by Allah.

1116
01:28:30,897 --> 01:28:33,987
In Bukhari(بخاريْ) and Muslim(ألمسلم), Abu Hurairah(ابوهريره) narrates,

1117
01:28:34,737 --> 01:28:40,736
the Messenger of Allah said: Allah has guaranteed the Mujahid(مُجَاهِد), who leaves from his home

1118
01:28:41,136 --> 01:28:46,549
with no purpose, but to fight in the Cause of Allah, and believe in your last words,

1119
01:28:46,898 --> 01:28:50,522
Allah has guaranteed for him, either to enter him into paradise,

1120
01:28:50,989 --> 01:28:54,289
or to return him home with a reward or booty.

1121
01:28:55,352 --> 01:28:59,353
So you're going out with a guarantee. If you die you go to Jannah(جنة),

1122
01:28:59,697 --> 01:29:02,696
if not, you're going to come back with Ajr(أجْر) and Ghanimah(غنيمه).

1123
01:29:03,932 --> 01:29:06,879
Abu Hurairah(ابوهريره) narrates the Messenger of Allah said:

1124
01:29:07,453 --> 01:29:10,443
There are three, whom it is granted that Allah will help them.

1125
01:29:10,643 --> 01:29:16,159
The Mujahid(مُجَاهِد) in the path of Allah, the slave who started the process of Mukatiba(مكاتبه) to free himself.

1126
01:29:16,813 --> 01:29:20,114
And the one, who wants to marry for chastity.

1127
01:29:21,458 --> 01:29:24,696
This is in Abdur Razzaq(عبدالرزاق), At-Tirmidhi(ألتِّرمِذِيْ) and Al-Hakim(ألحاكم).

1128
01:29:25,591 --> 01:29:27,111
The next heading:

1129
01:29:27,833 --> 01:29:34,417
is, Allah will never forsake the Mujahideen(مجاهدين), but would help them and respond to their prayers.

1130
01:29:34,817 --> 01:29:39,446
Jabir Bin Abdullah(جابرإبن عبدالله) narrates we were sent on an expedition by the Messenger of Allah,

1131
01:29:40,487 --> 01:29:42,572
to raid a caravan, owned by Quraish(قُرَيْشْ),

1132
01:29:42,830 --> 01:29:45,371
and he appointed Abu Hurairah(ابوهريره), as our leader.

1133
01:29:45,971 --> 01:29:49,675
This is an interesting story and it's in Sahih Muslim(صحيح ألمسلم).

1134
01:29:50,943 --> 01:29:54,793
Jabir Bin Abdullah(جابرإبن عبدالله) is narrating the story. He was a member of this Sariyah(سرية).

1135
01:29:55,678 --> 01:30:00,705
You have Ghazwa(غزوة) and Sariyah(سرية), Ghazwa(غزوة) is a battle in which Rasool Allah ﷺ participated in.

1136
01:30:02,411 --> 01:30:10,321
And then you have Sariyah(سرية), which is an army that Rasool Allah ﷺ did not join or it's a smaller army.

1137
01:30:11,534 --> 01:30:16,408
This was part of the economical war that Rasool Allah ﷺ was waging against Quraish(قُرَيْشْ),

1138
01:30:16,862 --> 01:30:20,018
it is to stifle Quraish(قُرَيْشْ), economically,

1139
01:30:21,034 --> 01:30:26,080
it's sort of an embargo on Quraish(قُرَيْشْ) to threaten their financial interests,

1140
01:30:26,580 --> 01:30:28,947
he would strike at their caravans.

1141
01:30:30,541 --> 01:30:34,226
So he sent Abu Hurairah(ابوهريره) to a place called Saif-Al-Bahr(سيف ألبحر).

1142
01:30:35,753 --> 01:30:42,530
So they went out and the Muslims were quite poor at that time.

1143
01:30:42,630 --> 01:30:50,628
So, Rasool Allah ﷺ had nothing to give them, but leather bags filled with dates.

1144
01:30:51,517 --> 01:30:52,108
That's all.!

1145
01:30:53,440 --> 01:30:59,511
Abu Obaidah(أبوعبيدة) would hand us one date per day.

1146
01:31:00,563 --> 01:31:06,738
So the narrator, the one who is hearing from Jabir Bin Abdullah(جابرإبن عبدالله),

1147
01:31:06,838 --> 01:31:08,863
he is asking him and what would one date, do.?

1148
01:31:09,234 --> 01:31:11,145
How could you survive on one date a day.?

1149
01:31:11,661 --> 01:31:15,924
So Jabir(جابر) said: We would eat it and then suck on the date seed.

1150
01:31:17,441 --> 01:31:18,756
And then we would just drink water.

1151
01:31:19,507 --> 01:31:22,241
So they will eat the date and just keep on sucking on that seed.

1152
01:31:22,803 --> 01:31:26,529
Try to get whatever nutrition they can and they will drink water that's it.

1153
01:31:27,062 --> 01:31:29,859
And they were starving. Going for days.

1154
01:31:31,099 --> 01:31:33,893
Living on nothing but water, and one date per day.

1155
01:31:34,736 --> 01:31:37,141
And while they were traveling on the coast.

1156
01:31:38,217 --> 01:31:42,366
They saw what appeared to be a sand dune.

1157
