1159
01:31:54,830 --> 01:31:56,698
So they said, this is Maytah(مَيتَة) we cannot eat it.

1160
01:31:56,758 --> 01:31:57,943
Now, when they say it's Maytah(مَيتَة).

1161
01:31:58,909 --> 01:32:04,936
Either this was before the Maytah(مَيتَة) of the sea was allowed dead fish,

1162
01:32:05,304 --> 01:32:09,219
or it was because it might have been there for some time, so it wasn't fresh.

1163
01:32:10,365 --> 01:32:11,834
So Abu Obaidah(أبوعبيدة) said: Don't eat from it.

1164
