But then after that, they're very hungry.

1165
01:32:15,353 --> 01:32:16,351
So Abu Hurairah(ابوهريره) said:

1166
01:32:16,503 --> 01:32:22,277
We are the messengers of the Messenger of Allah and we are Mujahideen(مجاهدين) Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله).

1167
01:32:22,877 --> 01:32:24,546
So go ahead and eat from it.

1168
01:32:25,290 --> 01:32:28,741
So they would go and eat from this fish.

1169
01:32:29,418 --> 01:32:38,390
The narrator of the Hadith(حديث) says that, Abu Hurairah(ابوهريره) wanted to see, how big the fish was.

1170
01:32:39,738 --> 01:32:48,185
So we had 13 of us, sit inside the eye socket of the whale,

1171
01:32:49,331 --> 01:32:51,333
