1172
01:32:53,116 --> 01:32:59,602
He said he took a rib bone and he placed it on the ground.

1173
01:33:00,163 --> 01:33:05,504
And then he had the tallest camel, and the taller Soldier ride on that camel.

1174
01:33:06,112 --> 01:33:11,688
And then he would go under the rib bone without knocking his head, it was huge.

1175
01:33:12,523 --> 01:33:14,092
The narrator of the Hadith(حديث) says:

1176
01:33:14,566 --> 01:33:17,358
We would pick up buckets of oil from the eye socket,

1177
01:33:17,702 --> 01:33:22,834
it's not oil but they would call it oil, it's fluid that you have in eye and they would eat it.

1178
01:33:24,542 --> 01:33:28,372
He said: We would carve out pieces of flesh as big as a bull.

1179
01:33:29,804 --> 01:33:35,249
He said: We would bring wood and put it under the just on the side,

1180
01:33:35,408 --> 01:33:39,215
and keep it burning, and then go and grab from the meat and eat from it.

1181
01:33:40,992 --> 01:33:46,415
He said: We stayed there for 30 days eating from that fish.

1182
01:33:48,296 --> 01:33:50,361
Until we ended up gaining weight.

1183
01:33:51,205 --> 01:33:53,705
He said: The flesh of our stomach was folding.

1184
