1186
01:34:06,623 --> 01:34:07,543
They were 300.

1187
01:34:08,870 --> 01:34:11,637
 Three hundred were eating day and night, fish.

1188
01:34:14,248 --> 01:34:20,904
And then when they were leaving, they had some of that meat and they would dry it,

1189
01:34:21,483 --> 01:34:25,701
