So they said: Yes! We did and they gave Rasool Allah ﷺ some of it and he wanted to eat it.

1196
01:34:47,982 --> 01:34:53,557
And this is an indication that the Rizq(رزق) that Allah gives to Mujahideen(مجاهدين) is Mubarak(مبارك), it's blessed,

